==Hindi==
{{wp|lang=hi}}

===Etymology===
{{root|hi|ine-pro|*reg-}}
{{root|hi|sa|रञ्ज्}}
{{inh+|hi|sa|रङ्ग}}, which is derived from the root {{m|sa|रञ्ज्}}, from {{der|hi|ine-pro|*reg-|t=to dye}}. Alternatively borrowed from {{bor|hi|fa-cls|رنگ|tr=rang}}. Cognate with {{cog|gu|રંગ}}, {{cog|mr|रंग}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{hi-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|hi|ə̃ŋɡ|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{hi-noun|g=m|ur=رنگ}}

# [[color]]
#: {{hi-x|तुम्हारे कोट का '''रंग''' क्या है?|What '''color''' is your coat?}}
#: {{hi-x|पत्तों का '''रंग''' गहरा हरा होता है।|The leaves are dark green in '''color'''.}}
# [[complexion]]
#: {{hi-x|उसके चेहरे का '''रंग''' साँवला है।|His face has a dark '''complexion'''.}}
# [[paint]], [[dye]]
#: {{hi-x|दीवार पर एक और '''रंग''' का कोट डालें।|Add one more coat of '''paint''' to the wall.}}

====Declension====
{{hi-ndecl|<M>}}

====Derived terms====
* {{m|hi|रंगामेज़||painter, one who applies color}}, also {{m|hi|रंगकार}}
** {{m|hi|रंगामेज़ी||painting, coloring}}
* {{m|hi|रंगक्षेत्र||stage}}
* {{m|hi|रंगभूमि||theater, arena}}
* {{m|hi|रंगीला||colorful, gay}}, also {{m|hi|रंगीन}}

